# Name: Scalloped Hexagon
# Summary: Alternating companion curves ripple around a six-lobed snowflake-like ring.
# Visualizer: turtle_2d
# Angle: 30
# Iterations: 3
# Max Iterations: 10
# Initial Color: 11

